[[7,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the vehicle is equipped with\nan airbag system, before carrying out any work the following preliminary\noperations must be carried out; (1) turn the ignition key to the\nOFF position and extract it; (2) disconnect the battery terminals\nand insulate them; (3) wait at least 10 minutes before continuing.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nRULES (see assembly 5508C - AIR BAG SYSTEM)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753205\">7040H10</a></p><p>1. Undo retaining bolts</p><p>2. Remove the hinge.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047080.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>Work in the same way to remove\nthe remaining hinge.</p>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the hinges and screw in\nthe fixing bolts without tightening them.</p><p>Carry out the following procedure with\nthe tailgate fitted:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753120\">7015A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753205\">7040H10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>Connect the battery terminals.</p><p>Check the operation of the Air Bag system\nusing the Examiner or other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]